# 2. HTML & CSS ⭐⭐

## Q11. What is Semantic HTML?

### Answer

Semantic HTML uses meaningful elements such as:

```html
<header>
<nav>
<main>
<section>
<footer>
```

It improves:

* Accessibility
* SEO
* Code readability

