# 12. ERROR HANDLING & ARCHITECTURE ⭐⭐

## Q70. How do you handle errors in Express?

### Answer

I use centralized error-handling middleware so errors are handled consistently across the application.

```js
app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
    res.status(500).json({
        success: false,
        message: err.message
    });
});
```

---

## Q71. What is MVC Architecture?

### Answer

MVC separates application responsibilities:

```text
Model
 ↓
Database / Data Logic

Controller
 ↓
Business / Request Logic

View
 ↓
User Interface
```

In MERN:

```text
React
 ↓
UI

Express + Node
 ↓
Routes + Controllers + APIs

MongoDB
 ↓
Database
```

---

## Q72. What is CRUD?

### Answer

CRUD represents the four basic database operations:

```text
C → Create
R → Read
U → Update
D → Delete
```

Example:

```text
POST   /users
GET    /users
PUT    /users/:id
DELETE /users/:id
```

